{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" initial=\"p\">\n  <state id=\"p\">\n    <initial>\n      <transition target=\"q\"/>\n    </initial>\n    <state id=\"c\">\n      <transition event=\"go\" target=\"q\"/>\n    </state>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"q\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml022-initial-escapes-parent.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml022-initial-escapes-parent.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":28,"endLine":4,"startColumn":27,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"initial transition target `q` is not a descendant of its parent\n\n**Note:** default entry must stay inside the compound state being entered\n\n**Help:** target a descendant state owned by the containing compound state\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.6 <initial>","text":"initial transition target `q` is not a descendant of its parent"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":132,"start":131},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"target declared here"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml022-initial-escapes-parent.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":15,"endLine":10,"startColumn":14,"startLine":10}}}],"ruleId":"SCXML022"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"default entry must stay inside the compound state being entered"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: target a descendant of the state that contains `<initial>`.\n\nSpecification: SCXML 1.0 §3.6 <initial>\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain SCXML022` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxm